<button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"3D Fabricated LED Letters\", \"description\": \"Large-format 3D fabricated letters with deep returns (6\\\" to 24\\\") for architectural installations. Welded aluminum construction with automotive-grade powder coating. Internal LED arrays provide even illumination across deep letterforms. Ideal for building-mounted corporate identity and landmark signage.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CHL-3D01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/3d-fabricated-led-letters\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_3d-fabricated-led-letters.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/3d-fabricated-led-letters\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LED modules)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"5,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What materials are used in the construction of these LED letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The letters are constructed from welded aluminum, ensuring durability and lightweight strength. The automotive-grade powder coating provides a high-quality finish available in any RAL color.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What illumination options are available for the 3D fabricated LED letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How are the letters installed on buildings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are these LED letters suitable for large-scale branding projects?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. With letter sizes ranging from 24\\\" to 120\\\" and deep returns up to 24\\\", these letters are ideal for architectural-scale corporate branding and landmark signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical brightness of the internal LED illumination?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The internal LED arrays provide brightness levels of up to 5,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility in both daytime and nighttime conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to standard flat LED signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"3D fabricated letters offer greater dimensional impact and depth, enhancing brand presence with architectural scale and superior light diffusion compared to flat LED signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty offered for these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty covering the fabrication, finish, and LED illumination components to ensure long-term performance and reliability.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"3D Fabricated LED Letters\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/3d-fabricated-led-letters\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>3D Fabricated LED Letters</h1><p>Order high-quality 3D Fabricated LED Letters in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE delivers durable and vibrant 3D LED sign solutions.</p><p><strong>Deep-dimension letters for architectural-scale branding.</strong></p><p>Large-format 3D fabricated letters with deep returns (6&quot; to 24&quot;) for architectural installations. Welded aluminum construction with automotive-grade powder coating. Internal LED arrays provide even illumination across deep letterforms. Ideal for building-mounted corporate identity and landmark signage.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What materials are used in the construction of these LED letters?</h3><p>The letters are constructed from welded aluminum, ensuring durability and lightweight strength. The automotive-grade powder coating provides a high-quality finish available in any RAL color.</p><h3>What illumination options are available for the 3D fabricated LED letters?</h3><p>Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.</p><h3>Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?</h3><p>Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.</p><h3>How are the letters installed on buildings?</h3><p>Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/