}\"}}]\n14:T606,<h1>3D Fabricated LED Letters</h1><p>Order high-quality 3D Fabricated LED Letters in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE delivers durable and vibrant 3D LED sign solutions.</p><p><strong>Deep-dimension letters for architectural-scale branding.</strong></p><p>Large-format 3D fabricated letters with deep returns (6&quot; to 24&quot;) for architectural installations. Welded aluminum construction with automotive-grade powder coating. Internal LED arrays provide even illumination across deep letterforms. Ideal for building-mounted corporate identity and landmark signage.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What materials are used in the construction of these LED letters?</h3><p>The letters are constructed from welded aluminum, ensuring durability and lightweight strength. The automotive-grade powder coating provides a high-quality finish available in any RAL color.</p><h3>What illumination options are available for the 3D fabricated LED letters?</h3><p>Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.</p><h3>Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?</h3><p>Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.</p><h3>How are the letters installed on buildings?</h3><p>Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\